 "response": {
  "text": "For **men’s jeans under ₹2,000 in India**, I’d prioritize these brands:\n\n### [Levi's Men's 511 Slim Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,279*\n\n### [Pepe Jeans Men's Holborne Mid Rise Straight Jeans]()\n*₹1,359.15*\n\n### [Flying Machine Men's Tapered Fit Jeans]()\n*₹1,409*\n\n### [H&M Men's Regular Jeans]()\n*₹1,999*\n\n### [Snitch Blue Comfort Fit Jeans men]()\n*₹1,689*\n\n### My ranking\n\n1. **Levi’s — best overall** ⭐  \n   If you find a Levi’s 511/512/513 on sale below ₹2,000, **buy it**. Current Levi’s India listings include several styles around ₹1,263–₹1,975. [levi.in](https://levi.in/collections/men-jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n2. **Pepe Jeans — best value/premium feel**  \n   Excellent choice if you want comfortable, stylish denim. Pepe currently has several men's jeans discounted to **₹1,449–₹1,999**. [www.pepejeans.in](https://www.pepejeans.in/men/jeans?utm_source=chatgpt.com)[magicpin.in](https://magicpin.in/blog/category/fashion/top-jeans-brands-in-india-men?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n3. **Flying Machine — best budget choice**  \n   Good for everyday/college wear, with many options around ₹1,000–₹1,600. [magicpin.in](https://magicpin.in/blog/category/fashion/top-jeans-brands-in-india-men?utm_source=chatgpt.com)\n\n4. **H&M — best for modern fits**  \n   Good if you prefer regular or relaxed fits; current options are around ₹1,399–₹1,999.\n\n5. **Snitch — best for trendy styles**  \n   Worth considering if you like contemporary/comfort fits and want something more fashion-forward.\n\n**If it were my ₹2,000:** I'd hunt for a **Levi’s 511/512/513 on sale** first; if unavailable, I'd choose **Pepe Jeans**, then **Flying Machine**.\n\nIf you tell me your **waist size (e.g. 30/32/34), height, and preferred fit (slim/straight/loose)**, I can pick **3 specific jeans under ₹2,000** for you.",
